<section class="section">
    <h2>4. Your visual checklist</h2>
    <ul class="check">
        <li><strong>Look / branding</strong> — logo, colors, fonts; first viewport must still read as ePartsCart / EcomAE.</li>
        <li><strong>Graphics &amp; 3D / motion</strong> — storefront piston/parts motion; CP/ERP/BOS login particles, rings, logo animation.</li>
        <li><strong>Functionality</strong> — PHP menus and modules remain the working product; ASP.NET apps are read digests unless dual-sample + approval.</li>
        <li><strong>Parity gaps to expect</strong> — many Wave 9–23 digests/apps still 404 on www until CloudPanel exact-route shadow install; hybrid ERP unauth may fall through to PHP login feel.</li>
        <li><strong>Evidence</strong> — <code>docs/migration/evidence/presentation/live-super-cp-tenant-probe.json</code> and <code>www-live-exact-route-probe.json</code>.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>5. Operator install (www shadows only)</h2>
    <ul class="check">
        <li><code>ECOMAE_CONFIRM_INSTALL_SURFACE_DIGEST_SHADOWS=YES bash scripts/cloudpanel_install_surface_digest_shadows.sh</code></li>
        <li><code>ECOMAE_CONFIRM_INSTALL_PRESENTATION_APP_SHADOWS=YES bash scripts/cloudpanel_install_presentation_app_shadows.sh</code></li>
        <li>Never broad <code>/cp|/erp|/bos|/storefront</code>; never tenant hosts without explicit confirm.</li>
    </ul>
</section>
